OL,3,CTour of Britain heading to Cumbria
OL,5,FIt sets off from Cockermouth at
OL,6,F11:30am before heading through
OL,7,FWhitehaven, Workington, Flimby,
OL,8,FMaryport, Allonby, Silloth, Wigton,
OL,9,FCaldbeck and Aspatria eventually
OL,10,Ffinishing with a circuit in the
OL,11,Fcountryside around Cockermouth. The
OL,12,Frace is due to end at around 3:30pm.
OL,14,FThe whole length of the race is
OL,15,F158.9km (99 miles) and takes in some
OL,16,Fof the Lake District's mountains
OL,17,Fincluding Clints Crags, Watch Hill and
OL,18,FRuddings Hill.
OL,20,FThe full list of stages is:
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G2/9
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
