PN,32203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F322A1787068093
OL,3,CTour of Britain heading to Cumbria
OL,5,FCouncil chiefs have warned of a number
OL,6,Fof changes to bus services along the
OL,7,Froute. There will also be temporary
OL,8,Froad closures and rolling road
OL,9,Fclosures along the route during the
OL,10,Fevent.
OL,12,FOne taxi firm in Cockermouth is
OL,13,Fclosing for the event due to the
OL,14,Famount of disruption that is likely to
OL,15,Fbe caused and say they will lose
OL,16,Fseveral hundred pounds in business.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G3/9
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
