FL,323,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F322A1787068093
OL,3,CTour of Britain heading to Cumbria
OL,5,FOn a social media post they said:
OL,6,F'With numerous road closures and
OL,7,Frestrictions throughout the day, we
OL,8,Fsimply won't be able to provide a
OL,9,Freliable taxi service, so we've made
OL,10,Fthe difficult decision to close for
OL,11,Fthe day.'
OL,13,FCumberland Council chiefs have posted
OL,14,Finformation on their website giving
OL,15,Finformation about the road closures
OL,16,Fand have urged people to allow extra
OL,17,Ftime for their journeys.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G4/9
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
