PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F322A1787068093
OL,3,CTour of Britain heading to Cumbria
OL,5,FThey add that there will be some
OL,6,Fdisruption in Cockermouth today (19
OL,7,FAugust) while event infrastructure is
OL,8,Finstalled.
OL,10,FA council spokesperson said: "The town
OL,11,Fof Cockermouth has experienced the
OL,12,Fbuzz of race day twice before, hosting
OL,13,Fthe men's race in 2015 and 2018, the
OL,14,Flatter of which was a team time trial.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G5/9
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
