SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F322A1787068093
OL,3,CTour of Britain heading to Cumbria
OL,5,F"British Cycling research, delivered
OL,6,Fby GSIQ, showed the 2025 Lloyds Tours
OL,7,Fof Britain brought an overall
OL,8,Fcumulative economic impact of #62.3
OL,9,Fmillion to the local areas which
OL,10,Fhosted the ten stages, bringing huge
OL,11,Fsocial impact to communities across
OL,12,Fthe country as well.
OL,14,F"Thousands of people will attend the
OL,15,Fevent, creating a boost to the local
OL,16,Feconomy.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G6/9
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
