PN,32207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F322A1787068093
OL,3,CTour of Britain heading to Cumbria
OL,5,F"The hosting of major cycling events
OL,6,Fsuch as the Lloyds Tour of Britain
OL,7,FWomen is part of partnership agreed
OL,8,Fbetween British Cycling and Cumberland
OL,9,FCouncil to grow cycling and tourism
OL,10,Flinks in the region.
OL,12,F"To enable the event to take place
OL,13,Fsafely, a combination of temporary
OL,14,Froad closures, rolling road closures
OL,15,Fand parking restrictions will be in
OL,16,Fplace across the route on race day."
OL,18,FBosses at British Cycling have also
OL,19,Fwritten to all residents and
OL,20,Fbusinesses within 100 metres of the
OL,21,Froute.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G7/9
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
