PN,32208
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F322A1787068093
OL,3,CTour of Britain heading to Cumbria
OL,5,FThe event in Cumbria will be the first
OL,6,Fstage of the Tour of Britain Women
OL,7,F2026 followed by four more days of
OL,8,Fcycling across England and Wales.
OL,10,FThe race is made up of five stages,
OL,11,Fand will work its way south to finish
OL,12,Fin Royal Leamington Spa.
OL,14,FThe region has a strong history of
OL,15,Fhosting bike races, and has featured
OL,16,F12 stages of the Tour of Britain Men,
OL,17,Fmost recently in 2021.
OL,19,FCockermouth itself has hosted the
OL,20,Fmen's race twice - in 2015 and 2018.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G8/9
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
