PN,32209
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F322A1787068093
OL,3,CTour of Britain heading to Cumbria
OL,5,FIn 2027, Cumbria will host two stages
OL,6,Fof the Tour de France Grand Depart,
OL,7,Fwith the first stage starting in
OL,8,FEdinburgh and finishing in Carlisle,
OL,9,Fbefore stage two leaving from Keswick
OL,10,Fand heading south to Liverpool.
OL,12,FPeople will be able to watch Tour of
OL,13,FBritain Women on free-to-air coverage
OL,14,Fon ITV4 and ITVX.
